# No global end-of-line normalisation: a few ps3recomp sources are CRLF and the patches carry that context byte for
# byte (the same choice as Project Helghast and Project Pyrrhus).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff2 binary
*.patch -text linguist-generated=true
re/*.txt linguist-generated=true
site/index.html linguist-generated=true
